BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FFXIV] PvP Series 11 Draws to a Close as Series 12 Begins!
DTSTART:20260908T093000Z
DTEND:20260922T093000Z
DTSTAMP:20260910T105501Z
UID:9befd4493679@mmo-calendar
DESCRIPTION:After myriad battles fought and won\, PvP Series 11 has ended.
  Rewards for Series 11 may be claimed until the end of Series 12.\n\n For 
 those eager to dive back into the fray\, we are pleased to announce that P
 vP Series 12 has officially begun!\n\n The more you play\, the more bounti
 ful the rewards\, so we encourage all players to try their hand at PvP!\n
 \n Read on for details.
URL:https://na.finalfantasyxiv.com/lodestone/topics/detail/2f2c083c28a8ca1
 83d8d7d8ea7bc994f9c7886d5
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FFXIV] Moogle Treasure Trove - The First Hunt for Astronomy Comme
 nces September 9!
DTSTART:20260902T093000Z
DTEND:20260916T093000Z
DTSTAMP:20260910T105504Z
UID:0a204f654124@mmo-calendar
DESCRIPTION:It gives us great pleasure to announce the return of the Moogl
 e Treasure Trove starting Wednesday\, September 9\, 2026!\n\nThis Moogle T
 reasure Trove will be a special edition to celebrate the upcoming release 
 of Evercold\, taking part across two installments and with an even more ex
 citing range of items\, including a special reward: an uolon horn!
URL:https://na.finalfantasyxiv.com/lodestone/topics/detail/7a376504f18acaf
 f4ffc60c1526f7354141c1a46
END:VEVENT
